                                        "entry_id": "04eba686-609d-3239-8257-3f5909dd4d62",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A company that flies airplanes to transport people and goods."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "6eefad38-d99e-4f75-ae56-1272f1b5f356",
                                                "sense_id": "9d232287-544e-36d6-9496-b29d625f21ba",
                                                "text": "But already there are some commercial air­lines in the United States which use airplanes cap­able of more than 200 miles an hour."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "e70ea5cb-89f1-4c82-b29a-6b72478702af",
                                                "sense_id": "9d232287-544e-36d6-9496-b29d625f21ba",
                                                "text": "They and the airline itself described an internal process that requires multiple departments to manually redesign the airline’s schedule – a system that works “the vast majority of the time,” Southwest said in a statement. […] Other airlines managed to recover by early this week; at Southwest, the cancellations only increased."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "0cd08cbf-695c-42fa-adef-034292c43a48",
                        "source_entry_id": "5c546ecd-b2f2-30e8-a203-213b2ac98914",
                        "source_sense_id": "096ea776-4582-3b0b-8848-7b1005c494a7",
